==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 4 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Cresselia ex Drop Event]], which ran from February 3 to 17, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Psychic Flash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Stellar Crown|Espathra|69}} from the {{TCG|Stellar Crown}} expansion.

